      "note": "Reviewed the exploit receipt and complete call trace, direct creation receipt, runtime at creation and immediately before exploitation, verified OMPxContract source, pinned reproduction, exploit-time state, and historical ETH price. OMPxContract 0x09a80172ed7335660327cd664876b5df6fe06108 is a direct Solidity 0.4 deployment whose runtime hash 0x3d5e00bc4c97981d2b270895a01c69466c564f9a42f4140b9d7eeae4bae1b9bf is unchanged from block 5417094 through the exploit. At pre-exploit state it held 1,799,614 of 2,269,323 OMPX supply as inventory. Pricing buybacks against total supply therefore valued purchased inventory as if it were an external reserve claim. The trace executes seven purchase/buyBack rounds; its fourteen victim-to-attacker ETH payments total 704.372869914943298279 ETH against 700 ETH paid in, draining exactly 4.372869914943298279 ETH. At DefiLlama's $2,465.70 incident-time ETH observation, the loss is $10,782.19."
